Package: bio215tools
Type: Package
Title: Introductory Tools for Biological Data Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "be-neuroflow", email = "yilinnnng@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides small, dependency-free functions for common introductory
    biology calculations. Tools include ecological diversity indices,
    deterministic logistic population growth, population doubling time, and a
    chi-squared test for Hardy-Weinberg equilibrium.
